silm:instances_papers_09_minimal_category_theory_chapters_01_objects_and_arrows_sections_04_concrete_anchor_survey_concrete_anchor_0_Mittens#mittens silm:hasLongDescription "The Mittens is the colimit-apex domestic cat individual; microchip-id 985112345678901, vet-clinic file F09-2026, body mass 4.2 kg. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
